      "value": "@{60285ca04963ba22994f485b|full_name}: The Issue that we were having is that the file produced junk files that were being feed into the data feed, our patreon list grabbed the names from the array it writes too so we can have our world give perks and update the board. The board suddenly stopped working after junk files reached its limit for JSON data meaning the board will no longer update. CSV however makes this more dynamic cause all it is, is calling back the names from a list instead of rewriting to a file and producing an output. If this makes any sense to you I don’t know.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
